{% comment %}
  ============================================
  SECTION 7 — REVIEWS (CAROUSEL)
  Whipped Tallow & Honey Balm
  ============================================

  HOW TO USE:
  1. Go to Online Store → Themes → Customize
  2. Add a "Custom Liquid" block on the product page
  3. Paste this entire file into the Custom Liquid box

  CHANGES (v2):
  - Grid layout converted to scroll-snap carousel
  - Single review per slide (mobile + desktop)
  - Swipe on mobile, arrow buttons on desktop, dot indicators
  - 10 real customer reviews (competitor brand names stripped)

  BRAND COLORS:
  - Primary teal: #2d6b5d
  - Accent gold: #c28844 (stars)
  - Cream bg: #f7f3ed

  ============================================
{% endcomment %}

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  .section-reviews {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 48px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    color: #2a2a2a;
  }

  .section-reviews__header {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-reviews__overall {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  .section-reviews__stars {
    color: #c28844;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }

  .section-reviews__rating {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #777;
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* Carousel */
  .section-reviews__carousel-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-reviews__carousel {
    display: flex;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 4px 0;
  }

  .section-reviews__carousel::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .section-reviews__card {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    scroll-snap-align: center;
    background: #f7f3ed;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border-left: 3px solid #2d6b5d;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    min-height: 240px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .section-reviews__card-stars {
    color: #c28844;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .section-reviews__card-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .section-reviews__card-body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .section-reviews__card-author {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #888;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Arrow buttons (desktop only) */
  .section-reviews__arrow {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e0d8;
    color: #2d6b5d;
    font-size: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 5;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .section-reviews__arrow:hover {
    background: #2d6b5d;
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #2d6b5d;
  }

  .section-reviews__arrow--prev {
    left: -22px;
  }

  .section-reviews__arrow--next {
    right: -22px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .section-reviews__arrow {
      display: flex;
    }
  }

  /* Dots */
  .section-reviews__dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .section-reviews__dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #d6cfc1;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .section-reviews__dot.is-active {
    background: #2d6b5d;
    width: 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .section-reviews {
      margin: 32px auto;
    }
    .section-reviews__header {
      font-size: 26px;
    }
    .section-reviews__card {
      padding: 26px 22px;
      min-height: 260px;
    }
    .section-reviews__card-title {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
    .section-reviews__card-body {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="section-reviews">
  <h2 class="section-reviews__header">What real skin looks like after switching.</h2>

  <div class="section-reviews__overall">
    <div class="section-reviews__stars">★★★★★</div>
    <p class="section-reviews__rating">4.9 average · Verified customers</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-reviews__carousel-wrap">

    <button class="section-reviews__arrow section-reviews__arrow--prev" aria-label="Previous review">‹</button>
    <button class="section-reviews__arrow section-reviews__arrow--next" aria-label="Next review">›</button>

    <div class="section-reviews__carousel" id="reviewsCarousel">

      {% comment %} REVIEW 1 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"My face finally holds something again."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">I'd been trying new creams for almost two years and nothing held more than an hour. This one absorbs in and stays through the whole day. I can do my morning routine once and not think about it again until bed. I can't remember the last time that was true.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Tanya S.</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 2 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"Like a cashmere blanket for your face."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">A friend recommended it. I was skeptical about the tallow part but I gave it a try. Once it warms on your fingers, it goes on smooth and comforting, almost like a cashmere blanket. Not greasy. And it lasts — I don't reach for anything else during the day.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Stephanie T.</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 3 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"I researched tallow for months before trying."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">I'd been reading about beef tallow for months before finally pulling the trigger. The scent is faint and a little goes a long way. Two weeks in and this is the first cream I haven't had to reapply halfway through the morning. Wish I'd ordered it sooner.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Katie F.</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 4 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"Both my daughters ordered their own jar."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">A few months in and I've stopped layering three products every morning. Just this one jar does the whole job. Both of my daughters watched me switch, asked what I was using, and ordered their own jars. That was the moment I knew it was working for real.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Lara K.</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 5 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"My husband asked what I was doing different."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">My boyfriend's mum recommended it. I'd tried so many things I almost didn't bother. Two weeks in, my husband — my boyfriend at the time — asked what I was doing differently. He never notices anything. That was when I knew I wasn't imagining it.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Natasha</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 6 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"My cream drawer is down to one jar."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">I counted eleven products in my bathroom drawer before this arrived. Eleven. Now it's one. One jar, four ingredients, and my morning routine takes two minutes instead of fifteen. I didn't realize how much mental space skincare was taking until I stopped chasing the next thing.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Rae F.</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 7 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"My foundation stopped cracking by lunch."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">This is the small thing nobody warned me about. I'd do my makeup in the morning and by 11am it would start cracking around my nose and mouth. I'd be in the office bathroom patching it up. That stopped the first week I started using this. I haven't thought about it since.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Maria P.</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 8 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"I won't go back to regular moisturizers."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">I'd been looking for a moisturizer with no chemicals, no fragrance, no junk. This was it. Easy to apply, melts in without feeling greasy, works for both face and body. Six months in and I won't go back.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Verified Buyer</p>
