      {% comment %} REVIEW 9 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
        <div class="section-reviews__card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"I've tried other tallow. This one is different."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">I've gone through maybe four other tallow balms in the last year. Some of them smelled off. Some of them felt waxy. This one goes on clean and actually holds. I'm not sure what they're doing differently in how it's whipped, but it works and the others didn't.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Verified Buyer</p>
      </div>

      {% comment %} REVIEW 10 {% endcomment %}
      <div class="section-reviews__card">
