        <p class="section-reviews__card-title">"Threw out seven bottles the day this arrived."</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-body">I'd been holding onto half-empty bottles in case I needed to go back to something. The day this arrived, I opened the jar, put some on, and by the end of the day I walked back to the bathroom and threw all seven of them in the trash. I haven't missed any of them.</p>
        <p class="section-reviews__card-author">— Vanessa D.</p>
